  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Many world features using pickups (especially ones that pin to the player) are fine-tuned for accessibility and have to depend on consistent pickup interaction behavior, especially for things that are accessed by the player by pulling them from behind their head. Changes that can completely break worlds like this should ONLY be done on the Worlds SDK-side, so that world creators can update them when their gameplay systems are actually ready for the changes. This would also reveal issues with changes far more effectively than the current beta client method.",
